; Swimming AI (@OP_Swim, SWIM-W3-001; Malprave's swimai2 steps): three soldiers swim to points in the bay, a crew of
; three swims out to the boat and boards it, a1 then swims 130 m on, and b3 goes over the side into deep water.
; This script only keeps a camera on swimFocus; swim-squad-orders.sqs gives the orders.
setViewDistance 1500
swimFocus = a2
swimRel = [10, -14, 8]
[] exec "swim-squad-orders.sqs"
_c = "camera" camCreate [9960, 1540, 10]
_c cameraEffect ["internal", "back"]
showCinemaBorder false
#loop
_c camSetTarget swimFocus
_c camSetRelPos swimRel
_c camCommit 0.4
~0.4
goto "loop"
